    "status": "passed",
    "notes": "Accepted as a medium-fi present-day exterior and approximate standard-map placement. Terrace heights, lost roof edges, individual damage, sculptural anatomy, support inventories and exact historic levels are visualization estimates. The causeway is deliberately fitted to the noisy native DEM; it is not a survey of level causeway elevations. No lost central sanctuary tower, complete bas-relief inventory, navigable interior or neighboring royal palace is reconstructed. Neighboring native procedural shells are preserved context, not verified reconstructions of those other monuments."
